  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports grid management and energy mix optimization for a diversified generator running 20 plants (gas, coal, nuclear, solar, wind, hydro). Personas: Dispatch Manager (real-time generation_mwh, dispatch_status, reserve_margin), Fleet Performance (capacity_factor_pct, heat_rate_btu_kwh), Trading desk (marginal_cost_mwh, curtailment_mwh, forecast_accuracy_pct), and CFO (dispatch_cost_usd, fleet mix).\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- Capacity factor = capacity_factor_pct; benchmarks: nuclear ~90%+, CCGT ~55%, coal ~50%, onshore wind ~35%, solar PV ~25%, hydro ~40%.\n- Heat rate = heat_rate_btu_kwh; CCGT best-in-class ~6,400, coal ~10,500 (lower = more efficient).\n- Reserve margin = reserve_margin_pct; NERC target 13-15%; below 10% is a reliability concern.\n- Curtailment = curtailment_mwh; renewable energy lost due to grid constraints or oversupply.\n- Dispatch efficiency = actual_mwh / planned_mwh; healthy >95%.\n- Forecast accuracy = forecast_accuracy_pct; day-ahead market benchmark >92%.\n- Grid frequency target = 60.0 Hz; deviations >\u00b10.05 Hz trigger ancillary-services response.\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - generation_kpi_monthly (source: generation_units) \u2014 dims: record_date, fuel_type, region, dispatch_status; measures: total_generation_mwh, avg_capacity_factor, dispatched_plant_count, total_plant_count, avg_heat_rate, max_generation_mwh.\n  - dispatch_kpi_monthly (source: dispatch_snapshots) \u2014 dims: snapshot_date, fuel_type; measures: total_planned_mwh, total_actual_mwh, total_curtailment_mwh, avg_reserve_margin, total_dispatch_cost, total_forecast_accuracy_percent, unique_plant_count, max_planned_mwh.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. plant_id, plant_name, output_mw, grid_frequency_hz, marginal_cost_mwh).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "Show monthly total generation MWh by fuel type for the trailing 12 months.",
    "Top 10 plants by average capacity factor over the last 90 days.",
    "Which fuel types had the highest curtailment last quarter, and what was the dispatch cost impact?",
    "How has average heat rate trended month-over-month for our gas and coal plants?",
    "Which regions are running below a 13% reserve margin, and how often this year?",
    "Top 10 plants by total dispatch cost USD year-to-date \u2014 and how does that compare to last year?",
    "What is the monthly trend in renewable (Solar, Wind, Hydro) generation as a share of total fleet output?"
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "What has been the peak energy generated in megawatt-hours each month?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT record_date, MEASURE(max_generation_mwh) AS max_generation_mwh",
        "FROM {fqn}.generation_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY record_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total energy generated in megawatt-hours trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT record_date, MEASURE(total_generation_mwh) AS total_generation_mwh",
        "FROM {fqn}.generation_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY record_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total planned generation in mwh trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, MEASURE(total_planned_mwh) AS total_planned_mwh",
        "FROM {fqn}.dispatch_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has average forecast accuracy percent trended by month?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, MEASURE(total_forecast_accuracy_percent) AS total_forecast_accuracy_percent",
        "FROM {fqn}.dispatch_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has the average energy generated in megawatt-hours changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT record_date, AVG(generation_mwh) AS avg_generation_mwh",
        "FROM {fqn}.generation_units",
        "GROUP BY record_date ORDER BY record_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total instantaneous output in megawatts over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT reading_date, SUM(output_mw) AS total_output_mw",
        "FROM {fqn}.generation_readings",
        "GROUP BY reading_date ORDER BY reading_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has the average operating reserve margin percentage changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, AVG(reserve_margin_pct) AS avg_reserve_margin_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.dispatch_snapshots",
        "GROUP BY snapshot_date ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "sql_snippets": {
